# FIX-19: VideoObject Schema for Product Walkthroughs & Video Demos

- **Category:** Structured Data (Video SEO)
- **Target Page:** https://incubrix.com/how-it-works
- **Priority:** P2 - Medium
- **Problem Identified:** Product walkthrough videos embedded on the site are invisible to Google Video search and AI multi-modal search.
- **Evidence from Live Audit:** No VideoObject schema found on how-it-works or homepage demo sections.
- **Validation Benchmark:** Google Video Rich Results Test

## Ready-to-Paste Code / Text Block

```json
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "VideoObject",
